        "answer": "Yes. It includes React Three Fiber scene patterns, loading states, controls, and scroll interactions."
      },
      {
        "question": "Is Spline supported?",
        "answer": "Yes. The skill explains when Spline is a good fit and shows a basic integration pattern."
      },
      {
        "question": "Does it cover performance?",
        "answer": "Yes. It covers model size, compression, mobile testing, loading states, and static fallbacks."
      },
